# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Mail. Without these three, no intake request and no coach application leaves
# the site. That is issue #17, and it is a launch blocker.
#
# The vendor is Resend, decided in issue #17. THE ACCOUNT BELONGS TO THE CLIENT
# and we only hold the key here, so nothing has to move when the engagement
# ends. No Vercel Marketplace integration: that provisions into the developer's
# account and bills him.
#
# In development you can leave RESEND_API_KEY empty. The mail is then printed
# to the terminal instead of sent, and the form shows its normal confirmation,
# so the whole flow can be walked without an account. In production an empty key
# is a hard failure: the reader is told we could not send and is given an
# address to write to, which is better than a lie.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# From https://resend.com/api-keys. Sending permission is enough.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# The sender. The domain has to be verified in Resend first.
# Defaults to "StudiekeuzeAdvies <intake@studiekeuzeadvies.nl>" when empty.
#
# DKIM AND SPF WAIT ON THE DNS MOVE (issues #17 and #23). studiekeuzeadvies.nl
# still points at the old WordPress on AWS and the DNS is in the seller's
# tenant, so the three Resend records cannot be added yet. Until they are, mail
# from this address will land in spam or be refused. Add the records on the day
# the domain moves, and check one real send before you tell a coach to watch
# their inbox.
MAIL_FROM=

# The archive address, and the reason a request cannot be lost.
#
# Every intake request goes to the coach AND as a copy to this address, so no
# request exists in only one place. It also catches a city that has no coach and
# a coach whose own address is still null in app/coaches.ts. A lead is worth
# about seven hundred euro; this line is the cheapest insurance there is.
# One address, and it must be a mailbox somebody actually reads.
MAIL_ARCHIVE=

# Where an application from /coach-worden goes. Optional: it falls back to
# MAIL_ARCHIVE. Set it when the client wants those in a separate mailbox.
COACH_APPLICATION_INBOX=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Maps
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Google Maps Embed API key, used by both Google maps: the work area on the home
# page and the city on a location page.
# Make one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis, enable
# "Maps Embed API", and restrict the key to the studiekeuzeadvies.nl domain.
#
# THIS ONE IS OPTIONAL SINCE 2026-08-20. Without it the pages draw our own map
# (app/components/nl-map.tsx) instead: first party, no cookie, no consent
# question and no key. The Google embed is the enhancement, not the floor. See
# docs/decisions.md.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY=
